exports[`Studio page > keeps its markup 1`] = `"<section class="pt-[var(--hdr)]"><div class="wrap sec-b grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-14 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><h1 class="d-xl col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-10">Mekânı çizen, <span class="w8">yapıyı</span> da takip eden stüdyo.</h1><div class="prose col-span-4 md:col-span-6 md:col-start-3 xl:col-span-5 xl:col-start-3"><p class="lead">Gül CAN Mimarlık, Aralık 2020&#x27;de kuruldu.</p><p class="mt-6">Konuttan ticari mekâna; ilk eskizden şantiye teslimine kadar projenin her aşamasında yanınızdayız. Mimari proje, iç mimarlık, 3D görselleştirme ve uygulama aynı çatı altında yürüyor.</p></div></div></section><section class="sec-b bg-kagit" aria-labelledby="fel-h"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-14 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><h2 id="fel-h" class="d-l col-span-4 md:col-span-6 xl:col-span-6">İyi bir mekân, neyi <span class="w3">boş</span> bıraktığınızla ilgilidir.</h2><div data-from="right" class="wipe col-span-4 md:col-span-4 md:col-start-5 xl:col-span-4 xl:col-start-9 xl:row-span-2 xl:row-start-1"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-beton"><img alt="Pencere önünde çizim masası, maket ve aydınlık sıvalı duvar. İllüstratif görsel" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 55%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 30vw, (min-width:768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio-atmos.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><p class="caption mt-3">İllüstratif görsel — stüdyonun gerçek ofisi değildir.</p></div><ol class="col-span-4 grid list-none gap-0 border-t border-pose md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-7 xl:col-start-1"><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,2fr)] md:gap-6"><span class="label muted pt-2">01</span><h3 class="d-m">Kütle</h3><p class="max-w-[44ch] muted">Taşıyan, saran, ağırlık veren: yapının sağlam kısmı. Önce onu doğru kurarız.</p></li><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,2fr)] md:gap-6"><span class="label muted pt-2">02</span><h3 class="d-m">Boşluk</h3><p class="max-w-[44ch] muted">Odanın kendisi. Neyin boş kalacağı, neyin dolacağı kadar önemlidir.</p></li><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,2fr)] md:gap-6"><span class="label muted pt-2">03</span><h3 class="d-m">Işık</h3><p class="max-w-[44ch] muted">Boşluğa giren gün ışığı. Plan, açıklıklar ve malzeme onun yolunu hesaba katar.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="sec-b !pb-0" aria-labelledby="kap-h"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><h2 id="kap-h" class="d-l col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-7">Neler <span class="w8">yapıyoruz.</span></h2><ul class="col-span-4 list-none border-t border-pose md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-10 xl:col-start-3"><li class="border-b border-pose/30"><a class="group grid gap-2 py-7 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,2fr)_2rem] md:items-baseline md:gap-6" href="/hizmetler#mimari-tasarim"><span class="label muted">01</span><h3 class="d-m">Mimari Tasarım</h3><p class="muted">Mimari Proje · Proje · Paket Proje</p><span class="card-arr hidden md:block" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li><li class="border-b border-pose/30"><a class="group grid gap-2 py-7 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,2fr)_2rem] md:items-baseline md:gap-6" href="/hizmetler#ic-mimarlik"><span class="label muted">02</span><h3 class="d-m">İç Mimarlık</h3><p class="muted">İç Mimarlık Hizmetleri · Tasarım</p><span class="card-arr hidden md:block" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li><li class="border-b border-pose/30"><a class="group grid gap-2 py-7 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,2fr)_2rem] md:items-baseline md:gap-6" href="/hizmetler#gorsellestirme"><span class="label muted">03</span><h3 class="d-m">Görselleştirme</h3><p class="muted">3D Modelleme · Animasyon</p><span class="card-arr hidden md:block" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li><li class="border-b border-pose/30"><a class="group grid gap-2 py-7 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,2fr)_2rem] md:items-baseline md:gap-6" href="/hizmetler#uygulama"><span class="label muted">04</span><h3 class="d-m">Uygulama</h3><p class="muted">Uygulama · Şantiye Şefliği · Anahtar Teslim</p><span class="card-arr hidden md:block" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li></ul></div></section><section class="sec-b" aria-labelledby="ofis-h"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><h2 id="ofis-h" class="d-l col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-7">Ofis</h2><address class="col-span-4 not-italic md:col-span-4 xl:col-span-4 xl:col-start-8"><p class="label muted">Adres</p><p class="d-s mt-4"><span class="block">Cumhuriyet Mahallesi</span><span class="block">Şehit Mustafa Sarı Sokak No:114</span></p><p class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-1"><a href="tel:+905425933175" class="big-link inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center">0542 593 31 75</a><a href="mailto:gulcan.mimarlik@gmail.com" class="big-link i